<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Santander started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santander started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns analyst Alberto Sanchez has started coverage of Banco Santander-Chile with a rating of attractive.</p>
<p>The bank &quot;offers, in our opinion, an excellent opportunity to play the Chilean banking system,&quot; he wrote in a May 21 report.</p>
<p>&quot;Most of the restructuring charges and provisions related to its April 1996 merger with Banco Osorno have been taken and personnel cost-saves of 25 percent have already been seen.&quot;</p>
<p>The company's ADRs were up 3/8 to 15-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
